    <briefdescription>
<para>Wrapper class for IR location info (IR ordering and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_loc" kindref="compound">DebugLoc</ref>) to be passed into <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_d_node" kindref="compound">SDNode</ref> creation functions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_d_node" kindref="compound">SDNode</ref> is created from the DAGBuilder, the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_loc" kindref="compound">DebugLoc</ref> is extracted from the original <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">Instruction</ref>, and IROrder is the ordinal position of the instruction. When an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_d_node" kindref="compound">SDNode</ref> is created after the DAG is being built, both <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_loc" kindref="compound">DebugLoc</ref> and the IROrder are propagated from the original <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_d_node" kindref="compound">SDNode</ref>. So <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_d_loc" kindref="compound">SDLoc</ref> class provides two constructors besides the default one, one to be used by the DAGBuilder, the other to be used by others. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
